sequenceDiagram
    participant U as IM 用户
    participant C as ImConversationController
    participant M as ImMessageController
    participant S as ImMessageService
    participant Q as ImStreamController
    participant A as Agent runtime
    U->>C: 创建 / 打开会话
    C-->>U: 会话 + 参与者
    U->>M: POST 消息
    M->>S: 落库消息
    S-->>Q: 发布消息事件
    Q-->>U: SSE 消息
    S->>A: 可选触发 Agent run
    A-->>S: 回复
    S-->>U: 回复消息
